advancement.shinobiaddon.blaze_release_acquired.title=Blaze Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.blaze_release_acquired.description=Your flames burn beyond reason — black, eternal, and unyielding. Blaze Release answers only to those consumed by their own power.

advancement.shinobiaddon.dark_release_acquired.title=Dark Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.dark_release_acquired.description=You have awakened the forbidden power of Dark Release — a chakra that consumes the strength of others and bends it to your will. Balance and chaos are meaningless before such hunger.

advancement.shinobiaddon.mud_release_acquired.title=Mud Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.mud_release_acquired.description=You’ve mastered the balance of water and stone, summoning the strength of the land to swallow all who stand against you.

advancement.shinobiaddon.steel_release_acquired.title=Steel Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.steel_release_acquired.description=No blade can pierce you, no force can shatter you. Through Steel Release, you embody the strength of the unbreakable.

advancement.shinobiaddon.swift_release_acquired.title=Swift Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.swift_release_acquired.description=You have awakened the Swift Release — a chakra nature that transcends motion itself. To your enemies, you are a blur; to time, a fleeting whisper.

advancement.shinobiaddon.typhoon_release_acquired.title=Typhoon Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.typhoon_release_acquired.description=You have awakened Typhoon Release — the storm’s true form. With every motion of your chakra, winds roar and seas rise. None can stand before the fury of nature unchained.

advancement.shinobiaddon.sevenheavens_acquired.title=New Fighting style
advancement.shinobiaddon.sevenheavens_acquired.description=A powerful breathing art that enhances strength, reflexes, and perception through seven controlled breaths. With each breath, the user’s body becomes lighter, faster, and more attuned to battle — until they move with the grace of the heavens.

advancement.shinobiaddon.1_tomoe_sharingan.title=First Tomoe Awakened
advancement.shinobiaddon.1_tomoe_sharingan.description=Your Sharingan has awakened its first tomoe, granting you enhanced perception and the ability to see chakra flow.

advancement.shinobiaddon.2_tomoe_sharingan.title=Second Tomoe Unlocked
advancement.shinobiaddon.2_tomoe_sharingan.description=A second tomoe has manifested in your Sharingan, improving your visual prowess and granting limited precognitive abilities.

advancement.shinobiaddon.3_tomoe_sharingan.title=Sharingan Mastery
advancement.shinobiaddon.3_tomoe_sharingan.description=Your Sharingan has reached its mature form with three tomoe, allowing you to copy jutsu and predict enemy movements with incredible accuracy.

advancement.ketsuryugan.title=Awakening of the Ketsuryugan
advancement.ketsuryugan.description=Your blood stirs… the Crimson Eye opens for the first time.

advancement.shinobiaddon.black_lightning_release_acquired.title=Black Lightning Release Acquired
advancement.shinobiaddon.black_lightning_release_acquired.description=You've mastered the art of Lightning release now you can use even more destructive lightning jutsu.
